<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Arumi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Urumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Attu o Urumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aru</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Urumi</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Urumi veekinaka yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napaolo iyaakha cho 54 ni 58 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Napaolo anene yaari ahinaphiya Urumi, paahi etu aalhempe waavaha malhehero attu yanrumelhenlhe Kuristo o iwani yo Urumi, onkhaye Ayahudi ni ayo ahiri Ayahudi. Yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha ikatema vaakhalha aya iwani yo Ukorintho, wa attu o makosho onkhaye anrumelhelhe ni umwiiwelhelha Yesu Kuristo (nlhako wo 16:26).</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha wa attu o Urumi iri yo ntheko mulhupalhe chinene wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo vakittu variwoothe ni ikatema choothe ukhalhawaya Napaolo anohimiacha mwaari wiira noopo nopattiya wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo vekha aya. Napaolo tho, anolhutaaniha chittu chihimiye ni Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo ni Malhehano o Khalhayi. Attu o ushoma enchi anohimia wiira nsitaari wo machiri chinene nhina ilha ikitabu ilha uri nlhako wo 1:16 uneera, “Akoonelhaka ishoni Malhove Orera ukhalhawaya machiri a Nlhuku phi noopolha attu onkhaye anorumelhelha. Achokholhaka Ayahudi ni kaanyuma attu ahiri Ayahudi!” Vanopachera aya ikitabu yo iwarakha wa attu o Urumi (nlhako wo 1-12) inohimiacha malhove o irusho cha Nlhuku wo nhina. Ni vonayelhi, (nlhako wo 13-15) nhochara meettuchiho menchi o ukhalha makhalhelho a attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anochokholha iwarakha aya wo wiichuwelhiha ni wiihimiacha yaari apani anolhepa ni anolhepa wa apani (nlhako wo 1:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anolhepa mwaha wo ukhalha rata thoko ntu chiri awe, ni noopo nopattiya wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo (nlhako wo 1:16).</para>
  <para style="io">Baada yo vavawo, Napaolo anoohimiacha ikano wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, cho ukhalha wo unrumelhelha Kuristo (nlhako wo 12:1-15:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Anomalhiha iwarakha wa attu o Urumi wo waavaha isalamu attu mu milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Urumi (nlhako wo 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Mii Paolo, karumiya a Yesu Kuristo, kiihaniye ni Nlhuku ukhalha namitheko ni ukithanlha wiira kaahimiachere attu Malhove Orera, kinoowiiha iwarakha uwaninyu.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Khalhayi vawo Nlhuku ahaalheelha attu Malhove Orera alha wo iphiro ya anamilhohi, thoko chaalhehiye aya ni Malhove Matakatifu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Malhove Orera alha anomwaacha Mwaana a Nlhuku, Athithi Yesu Kuristo, ayarelhe wo iruttu mwi iyari ya Adaudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />aapangiye ukhalha Mwaana a Nlhuku wo uhimiecheshiya ni Iphumu itakatifu ya Nlhuku, wo machiri molhupalhe wo uhihimushiya nnookhwani, Yesu Kuristo Athithi.<verse eid="ROM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Wo nlhatu no nchina nawe, Nlhuku hokivaha nnema ni ikuru yo ukhalha karumiya wo nlhatu wo waahimeria attu o makosho onkhaye wiira arumelhelhe ni upisha nrima. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ni inyu mwaatti nri Uroma va, Nlhuku hoothanlhani ukhalha attu a Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Paahi etu kinolhepa uwaninyu mwaatti onkhaye atakatifu anottuniya ni Nlhuku nri Uroma va, mwiihaniye ukhalha attu awe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anoolhakelha urwaa Urumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Wo uchokholha, kinonshukuru Nlhuku aka wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti onkhaye. Ukhalhawaya mwaha wo upisha nrima winyu uheewania ilhapo yonkhaye. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nlhuku kinonkaviha aka wo nrima waka wonkhaye uhimiechesha Malhove Orera o Mwaamwanawe, hoona chineera aka wo ulhapelhelhani kila ikatema.<verse eid="ROM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Mahuku onkhaye vanolhapelha aka, kinonlhapelha Nlhuku wiira wo uttuna wawe akivahe nipesha no uwa ushikuriani mwaatti. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ukhalhawaya kiri kithananaka uwoonani mwaatti, kiwe kookawelhani ibarakha cho munnepani chikivanhe awe Iphumu ya Nlhuku wiira kuulhipiheni munrimani. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ittu kinohimiaka vaa phi ilha, mwaatti ni mii nikavihaneke naashineneru ni upishihana nrima.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ashilhoko aka, nchuwelheke etu wiira wo ikatema chinchi kiholhakelha wiira kuweetelhelheni, nansho mpaka vano nna kihochiichihiya kihiire chiicho. Kinothanana attu o munlhokoni mwinyu anthimiche Nlhuku thoko chinre aya attu akina ahiri Ayahudi.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ukhalhawaya kihanaa ntheko wo weettuchiha attu onkhaye, Ayunani ni ahiri Ayunani, ni waahimiachera Malhove Orera attu o ushoma ni attu o uhishoma. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Paahi etu phi nothanana aka uhimeriani Malhove Orera mwaatti nnokhalha Uroma va.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Machiri o Malhove Orera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Akinoonelha ishoni Malhove Orera ukhalhawaya machiri o Nlhuku phi noopolha attu onkhaye anorumelhelha, achokholhaka Ayahudi ni kaanyuma Ayunani! <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Orera ahopatakulha Nlhuku chinaaratiha awe attu ukhalha o ikekhia. Ittu inokhalha wo nrima, uchokholha mpaka umalha waya. Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Ntu nopanga moombone mmiholho wa Nlhuku, nookhalha nkumi wo nrima wawe.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa Ntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nlhuku hopatakulha urushiya wawe wiirimu waaphiyelhe attu anonnyoholha Nlhuku ni uwonya wo upanga chittu cho uhilhoka ni ukhota wiira ikeekhene ihichuwanie. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ukhalhawaya chittu chinomwaacha Nlhuku chiri mwaari. Nlhuku mwanene phi pannge ukhalha mwaari. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Toka Nlhuku voopilhe awe ilhapo urata ni wooria wawe wo uhimalha wahochuwaniaa, inakhalhaka khawoonelhe wo miitho, attu ahoona wo chittu chonkhaye chuupilhe awe, yaani wooria wawe. Paahi etu attu kharina iphiro tho yo wiichaakiha!<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Attu ahochuwelha wiira Nlhuku hawo, nansho khanommaha nthimicho unomphwanelha mena khanonshukuru. Nansho irusho chaya chihooma ni mirima chaya chihalhaka mwiipiphini. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Aneechona ukhalha o irusho, nansho ahophupuwalhacha, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />ahohiya unthimicha Nlhuku ri nkumi, ni uthimicha isinyago chinoonia thoko ntu nkumi ama ashinuni ama ashinama o mieto micheshe ama anaakooko.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Paahi etu Nlhuku haahiya atware mirima chaya cho uwonya ni upanga chittu cho unanara cho mwiiruttuni mwaya. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ahorukunushacha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku wo woothacha, ni uthimicha ni ukaviha chittu chuupiye ni Nlhuku, wo uhinthimicha Nrata nophwanelhiya utotopelhiya mahuku o uhimalha! Aye!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ukhalhawaya ahopanga yayo, Nlhuku haahiya atwaretwareke nikakata naya no uhilhoka. Ata manyoopani ahohiya urupa ni manyaalhopwana thoko chuupiye aya ni upangacha chittu chihinophwanelhiya. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ni manyaalhopwana chiicho, ahohiya iphiro chuupiye upangiya nlhopwana ni nthiyana, akelhiyaka ikhwilhu ni uthelhanacha ashineneru. Manyaalhopwana ampangelhana chittu cho wuulhiha muru ashineneru. Paahi etu ahophwanelhiya upochera ntwarusho no iphiro chinowonya aya.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ukhalhawaya alha attu alha ahokhota ukhalha ni Nlhuku mwiirushoni mwaya, ni uyo etu haahiya mu uwonyani mwaya. Phi nlhatu vano no upangacha chittu chihimphwanelhiya aya upanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Yayo attu ayo ahocharacha milhatu chonkhaye cho uwonya, uthurulha chittu cha attu, nlhulha ni uhilhokalhoka. Ahochara ihache, niiviho, indewo, woothacha ni nrima wo unanara. Anowaapa, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />ni uhimiacha chittu cho uhilhoka cha akhunanaya ni uhinttuna Nlhuku. Attu o tiyamaru ni nikakata anoopuwelhacha chittu cho uhilhoka ni mena khanaalhoha manyanaangoro aayanre. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Kharina nrima woombone, khanokhulhuvelhiya, khanolhoka mena khanoonelha ikiriri ashikhunanaya. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ahochuwelhacha wiira ikekhiaye ya Nlhuku ahaamuka attu anottwara iphiro cho yayo manyaattu ayo wiira ahophwanelhiya ukhwa. Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, arii athepaka upanga chittu cho unanara ashineneru, ata ni waavaha nrima attu aneera chiicho.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ihukumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Paahi etu mwaahukumulhaka akina khanneechaakiha mena, ata nkhalhaka apani. Ukhalhawaya nnaahukumulhaka attu akina, uno mwaanene mpangaka thoko chinopanga aya. Paahi etu nneelhava mwaanene. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Vano nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku ri e ikekhiaye vanaahukumulha awe attu anowonya thoko chiicho. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Paahi etu, inyu nnaanyihera wiira nnonshemba Nlhuku ni khanowa o hukumulhani vanopanga inyu chittu cho uhilhoka thoko chineera inyu wo waahukumulha yayo attu ayo? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ama nnoheulhacha ikuru ya Nlhuku uvilhelhani ni uwehererani wawe. We ikekhiaye nhochuwelha wiira urera nrima wa Nlhuku uri wo uholhelhani nhiye uwonya. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Nansho itiyamaru ni ulhipa mirima winyu khannonrukunuwelha Nlhuku. Phi neecheshera inyu mwaashinene ntwarusho ninyu Nihuku no uhukumulhiya, Nlhuku vanowa awe wooniha urushiya wawe ni ihukumu ye ikekhiaye vanowa aya uhimiecheshiya.<verse eid="ROM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nowa unlhiva kila mmoka wo mitheko chawe. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Attu anothepa upanga moombone, aaviaka nthimicho ni ulhohiya ni Nlhuku ni uhikhwa, yayo anowa uvahiya ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Nansho attu aneechoona ni ukhota ikekhiaye, wiira atware uhilhoka waya, yayo Nlhuku noowa aahukumulha we ikekhiaye ni wooniha urushiya wawe. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Attu ammwonya anowa aahuva ni uttwaruwa, achokholhaka Ayahudi, tho ni wa Ayunani. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Nansho Nlhuku nowa waavaha nthimicho ni mpuha attu anopanga moombone, achokholhaka Ayahudi, tho Ayunani. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku khanonhukumulha ntu riyoothe wo ummweha wiitho.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Attu ammwonya ahichuwenlhe Malhehero a ashinna Musa anoowa aahukumulhiya inakhalhaka khanachuwelha Malhehero. Ni ayo ammwonya achuwelhaka Malhehero a ashinna Musa anoowa aahukumulhiya wo Malhehero ayo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ukhalhawaya kuhiwe attu aneewa Malhehero phi naalhakelhiya ikekhia ni Nlhuku, nansho anopanga chinolheeheriya ni Malhehero phi nohalha waalhakelhiya. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ahiri Ayahudi kharina Malhehero a ashinna Musa, nansho kila vanopanga aya wo uholhelhiya ni nrima waya thoko chinolheeheriya ni Malhehero, anoopatta ikekhia yo Malhehero inakhalhaka khachuwenlhe Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ukhalhawaya meetelho aya phi nohimiechesha wiira chinothananiya ni Malhehero chiholhepiya mmamirimani mwaya. Mirima chaya ni moopuwelho aya ashineneru anowaahukumulha, ama ikatema ikina anowenkelha. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Paahi wo ulhikaana ni Malhove Orera anohimiacha aka, phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku Nlhuku vanohalha awe uhukumulha chittu chivithiye mmamirimani mwa attu onkhaye wo iphiro yo Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayahudi ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Yakhalhaka etu inyu attu nneechiihana Ayahudi va, nnokhulhuvelha Malhehero ni wiititihacha wiira nri a Nlhuku, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />chani nhochuwelha chinothanana awe Nlhuku wiira nkhalhane? Tho, chani nhochuwelha chittu choombone chineettuchihiya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ni woona wiira nhaaholhelha attu ohoona ni ukhalha nthuko wa attu ari mwiipiphini, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ama nnowiichoona ukhalha owiittuchiha attu o uphupuwalha ni owiittuchiha attu ahinakhomaalha, ukhalhawaya nhina Malhehero a Nlhuku nhanaa irusho ni ikeekhene.<verse eid="ROM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Mwaatti nneettuchiha attu akinava, chani woonaka khanneettucha mwaanene? Nneettuchiha wiira nhiiye nansho chani woonaka mwaanene nnowiiya? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Inyu nneerelha attu “Nhilhavelhave.” Nansho chani woonaka mwaashinene nnoolhavalhava? Nnoovinga ulhapelha isinyago cho milhuku nansho mwiiyaka mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku mmo? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Nneefuna wiira nhanaa Ikekhia ya Nlhuku va, chani khanchuwenlhe wiira nno nkhota Nlhuku wo uhiya urumelhelha Malhehero? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Attu ahiri Ayahudi ahoruwana nchina na Nlhuku wo nlhatu winyu mwa Ayahudi va.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Wiinelhiya unyawo winyu unorera mwavarecheshaka Malhehero a ashinna Musa, nansho wo ikekhiaye mwaahivarechesheke Malhehero ayo, wiinelhiya unyawo winyu unokhalha thoko attu ahineenelhiya. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Attu ahiri Ayahudi ahinenelhiya unyawo avarakaru iphiro cho Malhehero, chani Nlhuku khanaalhakelha thoko attu eenelhiye unyawo? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ni inyu mwaatti Ayahudi mwiinelhiyeva, nnoowa mwaahukumulhiya ni attu ahiri Ayahudi wo uhiya winyu uvarechesha Malhehero a ashinna Musa, inakhalhaka nhanaa Malhehero alhepiye wo wiinelhiya unyawo, nansho ahiri Ayahudi yayo ahovarechesha Malhove inakhalhaka khaneneelhiya unyawo.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ukhalhawaya, kahii kila noonia Nyahudi nokhalha Nyahudi mwanenene ikekhiaye wo uyariya mena wo nlhatu no woonia wo vathe mena wo wiinelhiya unyawo mwiiruttuni. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Nansho etu, Nyahudi mwanenene phi ntu noonia wo nhina, eenelhiye munrimani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, kuhiwe wo marottelha arii mwiiruttuni mwawe. Ntu o totopelhiya noopochera malhivo ukhuma wa Nlhuku mena kuhiwe wa nttuni.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Paahi etu Ayahudi arinani waapwaha ahiri Ayahudi? Ama wiinelhiya unyawo urini? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Eiyo voombone wo iphiro chonkhaye! Wo uchokholha, Nlhuku ahaarumelhelha Ayahudi nkaavaha nttenga wawe. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Nansho inohalha ukhalha chani yakhalhaka akina aya khayari o upisha nrima? Chani yeyo inompanga Nlhuku hikhulhuvelhiye? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Mena kuhiwe! Nlhuku ri o ukhulhuvelhiya ikatema yonkhaye inakhalhaka wiira kila ntu ri owoothacha. Malhove Matakatifu vaneera aya umwaacha Nlhuku aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kila vanoolhumacha inyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">Nnowiiraniha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">Vanohukumulhiya inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">Nnoopatta ikekhia inyu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Nansho yakhalhaka wo uhilhoka wihu Nlhuku nonihukumulha we ikekhiaye, vavawo niireke chani etu? Niireke wiira Nlhuku noononelha vanonitwarusha awe? Kinookohani thoko ntu naninyu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ata mena! Ikaari chiicho Nlhuku akonrie chani uhukumulha ilhapo?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Yakhalhaka ntu mmoka nowooria wulhumacha wiira, “Uhilhoka waka unohimiechesha wiira Nlhuku phi o ikekhiaye ni o nthimicho, paahi etu khinolhoka mii uhukumulhiya thoko ntu o uwonya!” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Niireke etu, “Ngwee niwonye etu nipatte moombone?” Attu akina nansho, ahokiruwana wo ukootheria wiira kiheettuchiha attu nna nlhove nna! Wo ikekhiaye, yayo anoohukumulhiya thoko chinaaphwanelha aya.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Khaawo ntu neeraaniha wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Niireke chani etu? Hii na Ayahudi va phi attu o wiiraniha waapwaha attu ahiri Ayahudi? Ata mena! Ukhalhawaya kahomalha uhimia vaapachenre aka vawo wiira, Ayahudi ni Ayunani ayo onkhaye ari atawariyaka mu uwonyani. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Thoko chilhepiye aya ni Malhove Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Khaawo ntu ata mmoka rii e ikekhiaye.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Khaawo ntu o irusho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">Khaawo ata mmoka nomwaavia Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Attu onkhaye ahonhiya Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Onkhaye ahowonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Khaawo noopanga moombone, khaawo ata mmoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Vamalhakuni waya anokhalha thoko mahiye apatakuwilhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Malhimi aya anowoothacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Mmalhakuni mwaya nkhumaka malhove o wiiva thoko inwaa,<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Malhaku aya ahochara malhove o ruwanakacha ni ulhava.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Mieto chaya chinaakuvelha urihakachani iphome,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Kila unokelha aya anohiyacha mathalha o chittu chiphomolhachiye.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Khachuwenlhe ukhalha mumpuhani,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Khanomwoova Nlhuku ata vakani.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nihochuwelha vano wiira Malhehero a ashinna Musa ari wa attu ari wuuthi yayo Malhehero ayo, ikhalhe wiira kila ntu hikhalhe ni ittu yo wulhumacha, ni attu onkhaye ahukumulhiye ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ukhalhawaya khaawo ata ntu mmoka Nlhuku nompochera wo uvarechesha ikekhia wawe uvara wawe Malhehero. Nansho inopanga Malhehero iri phi waachuwelhiha attu wiira ahowonya.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kila ntu howonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Nansho vano, Nlhuku heesha iphiro yo waapochera attu wiira ahopanga ikekhiaye. Yeyo iphiro iyo ihikhulhuvelhaka Malhehero a ashinna Musa. Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni anamilhohi ahohimiechesha nenna nlhove nna. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nlhuku nowaarumelhelha attu onkhaye wiira ahopanga ikekhiaye anrumelhelhaka Yesu Kuristo. Nlhuku neera chiicho wa attu anrumelhelha ukhalhawaya khuuwo umwalhaana uriwoothe wa Ayahudi ni ahiri Ayahudi, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />kila ntu howonya ni uwukuwelhelhiya nthimicho wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Nansho wo mahalha o nnema wa Nlhuku, attu onkhaye ahaalhakelhelhiya ukhalha oombone wo iphiro yo Yesu Kuristo, nookholha. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nlhuku ahonkumiha Yesu, wiira iphome awe ikhalhe phi iphiro yo uhiyereriya uwonya attu anonrumelhelha. Aapannge chiicho oonihe ikekhia. Tho, wiira Nlhuku ahovilhelha nkaahiyerera wo uhaahukumulha uwonya waapannge aya. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Enre chiicho oonihe ihukumu awe wa attu onkhaye, wiira akhalhe e ikekhiaye wa attu onkhaye. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo Nlhuku mwanene nowooniha wiira phi o ukhulhuvelhiya, ni nomwalhakelhelha ukhalha o ukhulhuvelhiya ntu riyoothe nopisha nrima ni unrumelhelha Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Paahi etu, ninohalha wiifunelha ittu yaani? Khiiwo! Wo nlhatu waani etu? Uvara Malhehero a ashinna Musa? Mena, nansho wo upisha wihu nrima. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ukhalhawaya nrima wa ntu phi nomwalhakelha wiira hopanga moombone wa Nlhuku mena kuhiwe wo uvarechesha ihimiye ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ama Nlhuku ri a attu enelhiye unyawo mu upishani nrima vekha aya? Nlhuku kahii a attu ahiri Ayahudi? Eiyo phi Nlhuku a attu ahinelhiye munrimani. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ri mmoka, ni uyo nowaalhakelha attu enelhiye unyawo munrimani wiira ahopanga moombone wo nlhatu no upisha nrima waya, ni waaratiha ahinelhiye munrimani wo nlhatu no nrima waya chiicho. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Chani, wo nrima ihu ninowooria upitikusha Malhehero a ashinna Musa? Ata mena! Nansho, ninoothepa uvarechesha Malhehero.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Waalhikaaniha Aburahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Nuulhumacheke nlhove naani etu, no waacha athumwanihu Aburahimu? Ittu yaani yaakhumelhenlhe? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Paahi etu yakhalhaka Aburahimu ahaalhakelhiya ukhalha oombone wo mitheko chaya, anokhalhana ittu yo wiifunelha nansho kuhiwe wiithoni wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Kwaani Malhove Matakatifu aneera chani? Aneera, “Aburahimu ahonrumelhelha Nlhuku, ni wo nlhatu wo nrima waya Nlhuku ahaalhakelha ukhalha ntu e ikekhiaye.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ntu vanopanga awe ntheko khanolhiviya izawadi, nansho nolhiviya ittu inottuna awe. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Nansho attu ahinokulhuvelha mitheko chaya, anonrumelhelha Nlhuku naahiyerera attu uwonya waya, noolhohiya wo nrima wawe ni waalhakelhiya ikekhia. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Adaudi phi neera aya chiicho vanohimiacha aya mpuha wa ntu nopocheriya ni Nlhuku wiira horata, wo uhivarechesha ikekhia chaapanga awe,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Ahoreeriya attu ahiyereriye utteka waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">Uwonya waya uhohiyereriya!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Hopuha ntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">Hinaalhakelhelhiya ni Athithi uwonya wawe!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Chani yoyo mpuha uhimiachiye ni Adaudi uyo uri wa Ayahudi ahiinelhiye unyawo vekha aya? Ata mena! Uri mpuha wa attu ata ahiri Ayahudi ahiinelhiye unyawo ukhalhawaya kihoshoma Malhove Matakatifu wiira, “Aburahimu ahonrumelhelha Nlhuku, ni wo nlhatu wo nrima waya, Nlhuku ahaalhakelha ikekhiaye.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Chani Aburahimu aalhakelhelhiye veenelhiye aya ama ahinaya wiinelhiya unyawo? Yaari ahineenelhiya, kuhiwe veenelhiye aya. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Aburahimu ahopochera nthonyero wo wiinelhiya unyawo kaanyuma. Ni wiinelhiya unyawo uwo wooniye wiira, Nlhuku ahaapochera wo nrima waya ahinaya wiinelhiya unyawo. Paahi etu, Aburahimu phi athumwanihu attu onkhaye anonrumelhelha Nlhuku munrimani nkayaakelhiya ikekhia anakhalhaka khaneenelhiya unyawo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Chiicho Aburahimu phi athumwanaya attu onkhaye eenelhiye unyawo, kuhiweru wo nlhatu no wiinelhiya unyawo paahi, nansho wo uttwara iphiro yo nrima thoko waarina aya athumwanihu Aburahimu vaari aya ahineenelhiya.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehano a Nlhuku anopocheriya wo upisha nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nlhuku ahaalhehera Aburahimu ni achishaana aya wiira ilhapo inookhalha yawaya. Yayo malhehano ayo khayaapangiye ukhalhawaya Aburahimu ahovarechesha thoko chinothananiya aya. Nansho wo ukhalhawaya ahovarechesha ikekhia ya Nlhuku, nkayaapocheriya wiira ahopanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku wo upisha nrima. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ukhalhawaya yakhalhaka attu anohalha upochera malhehano a Nlhuku phi ayo anovarechesha Malhehero vekha aya, paahi etu upisha nrima khurini maana ariyoothe ni malhehano a Nlhuku khave ittu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Malhehero phi nowiiha nrusho na Nlhuku, nansho vahirii Malhehero, khavanooria utteka.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, malhehano anokhulhuvelhiya wo upisha nrima, ikhalhe wiira, yayo malhehano ayo anokhuma nhina nnema wa Nlhuku wa attu onkhaye. Kuhiwe wa attu anovara Malhehero nansho ata wa attu anorumelhelha thoko chenre aya Aburahimu. Ukhalhawaya Aburahimu phi athumwanihu hii onkhaye va. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Kihouthanlhani nkhalhe athumwanaya attu o makosho menchi.” Malhehano ari e ikeekhene mmiithoni mwa Nlhuku, anrumelhenlhe aya Aburahimu. Nlhuku naahihimusha attu akhwilhe nolhehera chittu chahaariwo chikhalhe. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Aburahimu ahorumelhelha ni ukhulhuvelha, inakhalhaka khawaariwo ittu yo ukhulhuvelha. Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, ahopangiya ukhalha athumwanaya attu o makosho onkhaye vaneerelhiya aya, “Achishaana inyu anowa ukhalha enchi chinene.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Aburahimu ahoolhuvalha aphiyelhaka iyaakha imia imoka, nansho upisha nrima khawaawukuwilhe inakhalhaka ahochuwelha wiira iruttu aya yaari yo uhichooria tho, ni ahanu aya, Asara, ahoriaka urupalha irukulhu. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Aburahimu khayaakelhiye nipampa vachulhu malhehano a Nlhuku, nrima wahaachara machiri, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ahochuwelha wiira Nlhuku nowooria utimiriha malhehano lhenhe awe. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Phi nlhatu etu “Nlhuku ahaapochera Aburahimu ukhalha ahaalhakelha ikekhia wo upisha nrima waya.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Malhove vaneera aya “Nlhuku ahaapochera Aburahimu ukhalha ahaalhakelhiya ikekhia wo upisha nrima waya.” Khineeriya wo nlhatu waya vekha aya.<verse eid="ROM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Nansho yaalhepiye tho wo nlhatu ihu hii naalhakelhiye ikekhia, ninonrumelhelha Nlhuku va, aahihimunshe Athithi Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yesu ahokumihiya wiira eeviye wo nlhatu no uwonya wihu, nkaahihimmwa wiira naalhakelhiye ikekhia ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ukumi uri wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ukhalhawaya vano etu Nlhuku honaalhakelha ikekhia wo upisha wihu nrima, paahi nihanaa mpuha ni Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Athithi Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Wo upisha nrima wihu Yesu honiwiiha urii nnema wa Nlhuku unokhalha ihu vano. Paahi etu ni hii ninottapelhelha ni ukhulhuvelha upatta nthimicho wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Eiyo, kuhiwe yayoru, nansho ninowiititihacha vanohuva ihu ukhalhawaya uhuva phi noniittuchiha uvilhelha, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />ni uvilhelha phi nonipanga ukhalha attu anaalhakelhiya ni Nlhuku, ni unaalhakelha wawe phi nokhulhuvelha ihu. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Wowo ukhulhuvelha uwo khunonuulhiha muru ukhalhawaya Nlhuku honihelha mmamirimani mwihu unittuna wawe wo iphiro yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku anivanhe awe.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Vaari ihu nihuperiaka, ikatema vayilhe aya Kuristo ahonikhwelha hii niri o uwonya va. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ihorika ntu ukhwa wo nlhatu no ntu o rera nrima. Nansho vakittu vakina, inowooria ntu ukhwa wo nlhatu wa ntu orera nrima vaattuni. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Nansho Nlhuku honooniha wiira noonittuna, ukhalhawaya vaari ihu bado o uwonya, Kuristo ahokhwa wo nlhatu wihu! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ukhalhawaya wo iphome ya Kuristo nihaalhakelhiya wiira khaniwonnye, iri ikekhiaye wiira ninowoopolhiya mu urushiyani mwa Nlhuku wo iphiro awe. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ukhalhawaya vaari ihu nivenganaka ni Nlhuku, ahoniiwananiha wo nookhwa o Mwaamwanawe uyo. Ni ukhalhawaya vano niheewananihiya, iri ikekhiaye wiira ninowoopolhiya wo iphiro yo ukumi wa Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Kuhiwe yayoru, nansho ninopangiya atakatifu wo alhe pannge awe Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Athithi Yesu Kuristo anaathaninhe ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu ni Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Uwonya wahowa velhaponi wo iphiro ya ntu mmoka, nkawammwiiha nookhwa. Paahi etu, nookhwa howanelha mwaattuni mwonkhaye ukhalhawaya kila ntu howonya. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Uwonya wahaawo velhaponi Malhehero a ashinna Musa ahinaya ulheeheriya, nansho uwonya khawaachuwaniaa vahiri Malhehero. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Nansho toka ikatema ya Adamu mpaka mahuku a ashinna Musa, nookhwa ahaatawara attu onkhaye, ata ahiwonnye thoko chaawonyilhe aya Adamu vaahilhe aya malhehero a Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu aari phi ikhove yo Kuristo aawilhe kaanyuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Nansho ikiriri ya Nlhuku khinlhikaana uwonya wa Adamu. Ukhalhawaya inakhalhaka attu enchi ahokhwa wo nlhatu no uwonya wa ntu mmoka, nnema wa Nlhuku waari mulhupalhe chinene. Ni mahalha awe ahowanelha wa attu enchi ukhuma wa ntu mmoka, Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Tho, ikiriri ya Nlhuku khinolhikaana ni iphiro cho uwonya wa ntu mmoka. Ntu mmoka vaawonnye awe Nlhuku ahohukumulha wiira, howonya. Nansho attu enchi vaathempe awe uwonya, Nlhuku ahaavaha attu mahalha awe wo waahiyerera uwonya! <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Iri ikekhiaye wiira, uwonya wa ntu mmoka wahommwiiha nookhwa. Nansho we ikekhiaye tho, mwaha waapangiye ni ntu mmoka, Yesu Kuristo phi mulhupalhe chinene! Attu onkhaye anopochera ikiriri ni mahalha wo ureerihiya ni Nlhuku, phi nowa utawara muukumini wo iphiro ya ntu mmoka, Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Paahi etu, wo iphiro yo uwonya wa ntu mmoka attu onkhaye ahohukumulhiya, chenre aya wo waapoteriha attu enchi, phiri aya wa ntu mmoka orera nrima chinaaholhelha awe attu enchi ni waavaha ukumi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Thoko uhiiwelhelha wa ntu mmoka chenre aya wo waahelha attu mu uwonyani, phi nokhalha aya urumelhelha wa ntu mmoka chinaapanga awe attu enchi ukhalha o rera mmiholho wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Malhehero a ashinna Musa yahowiihiya, nkayaathepiha uwonya, nansho uwonya vaathempe aya, ikiriri ya Nlhuku phi athempe aya chinene. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Paahi etu uwonya chenre aya wo waakelha attu ni umwiiha nookhwa, chiicho ikiriri ya Nlhuku yahothepa wo nlhatu no ikekhia, inoniholhelha urii ukumi wo uhimalha wo iphiro ya Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukhalha muukumini phi ulhutaana ni Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Niireke chani etu? Nithepeke uwonya ikiriri ya Nlhuku ithepeke wunchereria? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ata mena! Nahokhwa mu ikuru yo mu uwonyani, nansho vano etu nikhalhelhekeni muuwonyani tho. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ukhalhawaya mwaatti khannochuwelha wiira, vaabatiiziye ihu wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo Yesu, naabatiiziye wiira nilhutaaneke ni nookhwa awe. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Wo ubatiiziya wihu etu, nahovithiya vamoka ni uyo, ninkavihanaka nookhwa awe, ikhalhe wiira, Kuristo vanohalha awe uhihimmwa wo nthimicho wa Athumwanihu vawo, niwe naakhalha mu ukumi wo naanano.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ukhalhawaya yakhalhaka ni hii niholhutaana wo ukhwa thoko chaakhwilhe awe, ninoowa etu naalhutaana wo uhihimmwa thoko chenre awe wo uhihimushiya. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Paahi etu ni hii nihochuwelha wiira ukumi ihu wo khalhayi wahokhomelhelhiya vamoka ni Kuristo munsalaabani, ikhalhe wiira uwonya wiivarenlhe mwiiruttuni mwihu utanganyiee, nihikhalhe tho anamitheko o uwonya. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ukhalhawaya attu vanokhwa aya mu uwonyani, anowaalhakelhelhiya ikekhia ni uthaphulhiya ukhuma machiri o mu uwonyani. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Paahi etu yakhalhaka nihokhwa vamoka ni Kuristo, ninorumelhelha wiira ninowa naakhalha akumi vamoka ni uyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira Kuristo ahohihimmwa mena khanokhwa tho, nookhwa khanontawara tho. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Paahi etu, ukhalhawaya ahokhwa nkwaha mmoka, uwonya khurina machiri tho uwannyawe, ni vano nkumi mu ikuru ya Nlhuku mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, mwiichooneke wiira nhokhwa mu ikuru yo uwonyani nansho nkhalhaka akumi mu ikuru ya Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Kuristo Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Paahi etu, uwonya uhitaware tho iruttu chinyu cho ukhwa, nkamwaattwarattwara mattunelho aya. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Mena nhihiye ata itturi inyu imoka yunanariheni ni uwulhushani mu uwonyani. Nansho mwiikumiheke mwaashinene ukhalha isadaka wa Nlhuku thoko attu ahihimushiye, ni wiikumiha mwaashinene wa Nlhuku upanga chittu choombone chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Uwonya uhuutawareni, ukhalhawaya khannoholhelhiya ni Malhehero nansho nnoholhelhiya ni ikiriri ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhatu wo upanga moombone wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Niireke chani etu? Niwonyeke, ukhalhawaya khaninotawariya ni Malhehero, nansho ninokhalha nkiririni mwa Nlhuku? Ata vakani mena! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Mwaatti nhochuwelha wiira vaneekumiha inyu mwaashinene ukhalha ipotta i naneshe, vavawo nhokhalha ipotta wa ayo nnewelhelha inyu ayo. Vanokhalha inyu ipotta yo uwonya nnokelha unookhwani, ama wiitimarikha mmiholho wa Nlhuku unoorweehani ukhalha ipotta yo upanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku chinene, ukhalhawaya khalhayi mwaari ipotta mu uwonyani, nansho vano nhorumelhelha wo nrima winyu wonkhaye ikeekhene nneettuchihiya inyu. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Mwahohiyereriya ukhuma mu uwonyani ni upangiya ipotta vano yo chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Vaa kinoolhumacha thoko chinoolhumacha aya attu akina wo nlhatu no uphupuwalha winyu. Thoko cheekuminhe inyu mwaashinene ikatema imoka ukhalha ipotta yo chittu cho uhilhoka ni uwonya, paahi etu mwiikumiheke mwaashinene vano uweha iphiro chinothanana awe Nlhuku, ni wo nlhatu wo ukhalha atakatifu.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ikatema vaari inyu ipotta yo mu uwonyani, mwaari nnahiyereriye. Ikekhiaye yaari utayi ni inyu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Mwaaphunreni vaapanga inyu chittu cho uhilhoka chinowuulhihani muru vano chiyo? Ukhalhawaya ittu inokhumelhelha vanomalha aya chechiyo chittu chonkhaye chiyo, phi nookhwa! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Nansho vano nhohiyereriya mu uwonyani ni ukhalha vano ipotta ya Nlhuku. Paahi etu, mahalha anopatta inyu phi ikekhiaye inoovahani utakatifu unohalha umalhelha urii ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ukhalhawaya malhivo o uwonya phi nookhwa, nansho ikiriri ya Nlhuku phi ukumi wo uhimalha mu ulhutaanani ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ulhikaanihiya mwaha wo nthelhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ashilhoko aka nnoochuwelha malhove kinohalha aka uhimeriani, ukhalhawaya mwaatti onkhaye nhochuwelha chittu chinaacha malhehero. Chechiyo chinontawara ntu ri nkumi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Niireke wiira, opani o munthelhini, anottukiya ni malhehano o owannyaya ikatema yonkhaye vari aya akumi, nansho arimeelhaka, paahi vavawo ahohiyereriya malhehero aattuka ayo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Paahi opani ayo avekiyaka ni alhopwana akina uno owannyaya anari akumi, aneerelhiya wiira aholhavalhava. Nansho alhopwana ayo akhwaaka, Malhehero ahaahiyerera, avekiyaka khaneerelhiya tho wiira aholhavalhava.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Phiri aya chiicho uwaninyu mwaatti, ashilhoko aka va. Mwaatti nhokhwelha Malhehero wo ulhutaana ni iruttu ya Kuristo, ni ukhalha vano attu a ntu nkina, uyo hihimmwe, wiira nimpangelhe Nlhuku moombone. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ukhalhawaya vaari ihu nitawariyaka ni iruttu, nikakata no uwonya ninthotheriya ni Malhehero, naari ninipahaka mwiiruttuni mwihu, nimalhelhaka unookhwani. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Nansho vano, Malhehero khannittuka tho, ukhalhawaya nihokhwa wo mwaha waaneesha ipotta, wiira nivare ntheko wo ukumi wo naanano wo iphiro yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, kuhiwe wo iphiro yo khalhayi yo Malhehero ilhepiye.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehero ni uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Vano niireke chani etu? Niireke wiira Malhehero phi uwonya? Ata mena! Nansho wo ikekhiaye Malhehero phi kichuwelhinhe mii uwonya phi ishiyani. Yakhalhaka malhehero khayaahimmie wiira, “Nhimirelhe ishenye chittu cha attu akina.” Khakaachuwelha umirelha ishenye phi ishiyani. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Nansho wo yayo Malhehero ayo, uwonya wahopatta iphiro yo uthotheria nikakata no uhilhoka mwiiruttuni mwaka. Ukhalhawaya Malhehero ahikhalheke, uwonya khuuwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Khalhayi, kaari ki ntu nkumi kihiri ni Malhehero, nansho Malhehero vaawilhe aya, uwonya wahohihimmwa, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />nkakaakhwa. Malhehero yaathananiya uwiiha ukumi, uwannyaka yahommwiiha nookhwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ukhalhawaya uwonya wahopatta iphiro yaavahiye aya wo malhehero, nkawaakithepia ni ukiiva.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Paahi etu, Malhehero aneneru arii matakatifu, ni malhehero tho phi matakatifu, o ikekhiaye ni oombone. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Chani etu, ittu yoombone iyo ihommwiiha nookhwa? Ata vakani kuhiwe! Yaapangelhe chiicho wiira uwonya woonie mwaari, uchuwaniee wiira phi uwonya. Nkayaavara ittu yoombone ni ummwiiha nookhwa aka. Chiichammo etu, malhehero yahooniha uwonya chiri aya wo uhilhoka.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikhoto mwiiruttuni mwa ntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Nihochuwelha wiira Malhehero arii o munnepani, nansho mii o mwiiruttuni, kihothumihiya ukhalha ipotta yo mu uwonyani. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Akichuwenlhe ittu kinopanga aka, ukhalhawaya akinopanga ittu kinothanana aka upanga, nansho kinopanga ittu inovenga aka. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Paahi etu kapangaka ittu kihinottuna aka upanga, vavawo etu kihorumelhelha wiira, Malhehero ari orera. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Akihiwe mii etu nopanga chiicho, nansho uwonya unkhalha nhina mwaka phi nopanga chiicho. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Kihochuwelha wiira khiiwo ittu iriyoothe yoombone inokhalha nhina mwaka, mwiiruttuni mwaka mwo uwonya. Ukhalhawaya ata kithananaka upanga chittu cho ikekhiaye, akinooria upanga chiicho. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ukhalhawaya akinopanga ittu yoombone kinothanana aka upanga, nansho kiwonyaka kihithananaka uwonya. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Kapangaka ittu yo uhilhoka, akinopanga wo uttuna waka, nansho uwonya wo mwiiruttuni mwaka phi nopanga.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Paahi malhehero makina vano, kila vanothanana aka upanga ittu yorera, uwonya urii vavawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Nhina munrimani waka Malhehero a Nlhuku anokiteelhiha. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />nansho koonaka wiira ihaawo iphiro ikina inopanga ntheko mwiiruttuni mwaka, Malhehero ahinaathana ni iphiro inopocheriya ni irusho chaka. Yeyo phi nokipanga ukhalha ipotta yo malhehero yo uwonya unokivaravara mwiiruttuni mwaka. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Kihohuva mii! Mpani nohalha ukoopolha mwiiruttuni nnokirweeha unookhwani? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku nopanga chittu wo iphiro ya Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Alha vano, phi makhalhelho aka, mii kimwanene wo irusho chaka kinoovara ntheko wo malhehero a Nlhuku, nansho mwiiruttuni mwaka kinovara malhehero o uwonya.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ukumi wo iphiro yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Paahi etu, khuuwo vano uhukumulhiya uriwoothe wa attu alhutaanne ni Kuristo Yesu mu ukumini mwaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ukhalhawaya wo iphiro ya Kuristo Yesu, Malhehero o Iphumu yo ukumi ahokihiyerera mii uthama malhehero o uwonya ni o nookhwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nlhuku ahopanga alhe yahooriye upangiya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa alhe wo nlhatu no iruttu ya ntu o uwonya ukhalha khayaari ni machiri. Nlhuku hopanga yayo wo unruma Mwaamwanawe o yekha, aawilhe wo iruttu thoko ya ntu o uwonya awe aahukumulha uwonya wo iruttu awe iyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nlhuku aapannge ikhalhe wiira ilheheriye ni ikekhia ipangiye rata nhina mwihu hii ninotwara iphiro cho Iphumu ya Nlhuku va, nihinottwara mathananelho o iruttu cho uwonya.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Attu onkhaye anokhalha thoko chinothanana aya iruttu, anotawariya ni nikakata no mwiiruttuni. Nansho attu onkhaye anokhalha thoko chinothanana awe Iphumu ya Nlhuku, yayo anotawariya ni mathananelho o Iphumu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ukhalhawaya irusho cha ntu o uwonya phinommwiiha nookhwa, nansho chittu chinotawariya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku phi nowiiha ukumi ni mpuha. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Irusho chinoholhelhiya ni iruttu phi naapanga attu ooniye uhilhoka uholho wa Nlhuku ukhalhawaya khanooria uvara malhehero a Nlhuku mena khanovarechesha. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Attu anotawariya ni mathananelho o iruttu khanonteelhiha Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Nansho mwaattiva Iphumu ya Nlhuku rii nhina mwinyu. Ni vano khannoholhelhiya ni iruttu nansho ni Iphumu ya Kuristo. Ntu riyoothe hiri ni Nnepa wa Kuristo, yoyo kahiwe a Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Nansho Kuristo akhalhaka nhina mwinyu inakhalhaka iruttu chinyu chihokhwa wo nlhatu no uwonya, Iphumu ya Nlhuku phi ukumi inyu ukhalhawaya nhopanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Yakhalhaka Iphumu ya Nlhuku anhihimushilhe Kuristo Yesu iri vamoka ni inyu, paahi uyo nhihimunshe Yesu uyo, novaha iruttu chinyu cho ukhwa chi, ukumi wo iphiro yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku awe nokhalha vamoka ni inyu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Paahi etu ashilhoko aka, nihanaa ntheko, nansho kuhii wo ukhalha thoko iruttu chihu cho uwonya chi chinothanana aya. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ukhalhawaya mwattwaraka nikakata no mwiiruttuni mwo uwonya, we ikekhiaye nnookhwa. Nansho mwakhalhakaru ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nnowiivakacha mitheko chinyu cho uwonya chiyo, ni ukhalha akumi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye anoholhelhiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, phi ashaana a Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ukhalhawaya Iphumu ya Nlhuku mumpochenre inyu wa Nlhuku, khanoopangani tho ipotta ni uwoopopihani, nansho, Iphumu uyo noupangani vano ashaana a Nlhuku, ni wo yoyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku uyo ninomwiihana Nlhuku niiraka, “Aba!” Yaani “Thithi!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku nohimiechesha minepa chihu wiira hii phi ashaana a Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Paahi ukhalhawaya wo ikekhiaye vano hii phi ashaana a Nlhuku, ninoopochera vamoka ni Kuristo chittu choombone chihiyeriye ihu ni Nlhuku wa attu awe. Ukhalhawaya nahuvaka vamoka ni Kuristo, ninoowa naapochera nthimicho wawe vamoka.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nthimicho unowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha wiira uhuva wo vano ulha khuve ittu nalhikaanihaka ni nthimicho unowa ihu upatakulhelhiya uyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Chittu chuupiye chonkhaye chinooweherera woona Nlhuku vanaapatakhulha awe ashaana awe. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ukhalhawaya chittu chuupiye chooniye wiira ninootwaruwa wo uhittuna naashineneru, nansho ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahottuna ikhalhe chiicho. Nansho nikhulhuvelhaka wiira, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />chittu chuupiye chinowa uhiyereriya nihuku nimoka ukhuma mpottani munonta ni upatta unethi wo nthimicho wa ashaana a Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira, mpaka vano nna, chittu chonkhaye chinowunlha thoko nkuri chineera aya wo uweria. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Nansho khachihiwe chittu chuupiye tu, nansho ata ni hii niri ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku rii mahalha o upachera a Nlhuku, ninowiipulhelha chiicho, niwehereraka Nlhuku awe anipanga achishaana awe, ni iruttu chihu chiwe choopolhiya. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ukhalhawaya wo ukhulhuvelha uwo nihoopolhiya, nansho wowo ukhulhuvelha uwo khunokhalha ni maana yakhalhaka ninowoona ittu inokhulhuvelha ihu iyo. Phi mpani etu nokhulhuvelha ittu inoona awe? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Nansho vanokhulhuvelha ihu ittu ihinoona ihu, ninoweherera wo uvilhelha.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Chiichammo etu, Iphumu ya Nlhuku noonikaviha hii o uhupeeria va, ukhalhawaya khanichuwenlhe chinothananiya ihu vanolhepelha ihu. Nansho Iphumu ya Nlhuku noonilhapelhelha wa Nlhuku eepulhelhaka vahinohimiaa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Nlhuku noona mpaka nhina mmamirimani mwihu, hochuwelha moopuwelho o Iphumu ya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowaalhapelhelha attu wa Nlhuku wo mattunelho awe Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Nihochuwelha wiira, wo chittu chonkhaye Nlhuku nopanga ni utimiriha rata vamoka ni attu anonttuna, ehanne awe wo uthanana wawe. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahaachuwelha yayo attu ayo toka khalhayi. Nkaathanlha wiira alhikaane ni Mwaamwanawe akhalhe o upachera munlhokoni mwa ashilhoko awe enchi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Paahi alhe Nlhuku aathanlhe awe toka khalhayi ayo, aheehanacha, ni yayo ehananche awe ayo ahaalhakelha ikekhia. Ni ayo alhakenlhe awe ikekhia ayo ahaakawelha nthimicho awe.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uttuna wa Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Wo yayo etu, niireke chani vano? Nlhuku akhalhaka mpatta wihu mpani etu nohalha univinga? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nlhuku khamwonenlhe ikiriri ata Mwaamwanawe o yekha, nansho ahonhiyerera wo nlhatu wihu hii onkhaye va. Yakhalhaka ahopanga chiicho khanowa etu aanivaha nnema onkhaye vamoka ni uyo? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Mpani etu nohalha waaria milhatu attu athanlhiye ni Nlhuku? Nlhuku mwanene haalhakelha ikekhia wiira, khattenke! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Mpani etu, nohalha waahukumulha? Khaawo! Ukhalhawaya Yesu Kuristo mwanene phi akhwilhe, nkaahihimmwa, vano nokhalha wiimonono wa Nlhuku. Yoyo phi nonilhapelhelha! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Mpani etu, nohalha unimwalhaaniha ni uttuna wa Kuristo? Chani, uhuva ama uvelhavelha ama uttwaruwa ama ithalha ama ushauchi ama itatako ama nookhwa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Wo nlhatu winyu, niri ntatakoni mwo nookhwa uthana ni uhiyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">Nipangiyaka thoko ikhondoro chinorwehiya uhithiyani.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Nansho nhina chittu chonkhaye chiyo, nihokottolha chinene wo ukavihiya ni yoyo nonittuna uyo! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ukhalhawaya kihochuwelha wiira khiiwo ittu inohalha unimwalhaaniha ni uttuna wawe, kahii nookhwa mena ukumi, kachihiwe minepa mena minepa o wiirimu akina, mena ahoolhelhi, mena ikatema yo naanano mena ikatema inowa mena attu o ikuru, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />mena ilhapo yo nchulhu mena ilhapo yo vathi. Khiiwo ittu yuupiye iri ni machiri o unimwaalhaniha ni uttuna wa Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Kuristo Yesu Athithi.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku ni attu awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Kinohimiacha aka phi ikeekhene, mii ki ntu a Kuristo akinoothacha. Nrima aka unoholhelhiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku phi nokihimiechesha. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nrima aka uhokelhiya ihuzuni yo uweria uhinomalha, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />ukhalhawaya wo nlhatu wo mahalha a ashilhoko aka, attu o nikosho naka, kanlhapelha wiira Nlhuku akilhave ni ukimwalhaaniha ni Kuristo. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Yayo phi attu o Uisraeli, Nlhuku aapannge awe ukhalha achishaana awe ni waavaha nthimicho awe, alhehanne awe ni waavaha Malhehero awe, ni Inupa awe yo unthimicha ni malhehano awe. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Yayo phi uchuulhu wa manyaapwiiya e Iburaniya. Ni Kuristo ayariaka unikoshoni waya. Nlhuku notawara chittu chonkhaye, atotopelhiye mahuku o uhimalha! Aye.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Kineera aka phi ilha, malhove a Nlhuku khoochenlhe utimirihiya. Ukhalhawaya kuhiwe kila ntu yarelhe mwa Aisraeli phi ntu a Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Mena kahii attu onkhaye anokhuma wi iyari ya Aburahimu, phi nohalha upochera malhehano. Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahalheeha Aburahimu wiira, “Ashichulhu inyu o malhehano anohalha ukhuma u Naisaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Maana aya anokhalha wiira ayarelhe ntu kahiwe phi ashaana a Nlhuku. Nansho ashaana ayarelhe wo malhehano a Nlhuku phi nohalha wiihaniya ashaana a Aburahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ukhalhawaya malhehano a Nlhuku aneera, “Ikatema vanohalha aya uphiya kinoohokolhia, ni Asara anowa unnyara mwaana.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kuhiwe yayoru. Arabeka ni ayo ahaayara mavata wa athumwanaya amoka apwiiya Naisaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Nansho wo wooniha wiira Nlhuku noworia uthanlha, ata yayo ashaana elhi ayo ahinayariaa mena ahinachuwelha waanyulha moombone ni uwonya, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Narabeka aheerelhiya wiira, “Mwaana mulhupalhe uyo noowa aarumiya uvara ntheko ni mwankani uyo.” Paahi etu uthanlha wa Nlhuku uri wo uttuna wawe, mena kuhiwe wo ittu iriyoothe ipangiye ni ntu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Kahonttuna Yakhobo, nansho Esau kinonvenga.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Niireke chani etu? Nlhuku vavawo khapannge ittu yo ulhoka? Ata mena! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ukhalhawaya aheerelha ashinna Musa, “Kinonchukulhelha ntu riyoothe kinonthanana aka unchukulhelha, kinomoonelha ikiriri ntu riyoothe kinonttuna aka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Paahi etu chittu chonkhaye chinokhulhuvelha ikiriri ya Nlhuku, mena kuhii wo mitheko ama chinothanana awe ntu.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera Nlhuku aheerelha Nafarao, “Kahouvarani umwene wiira uwaninyu ikuru aka yooniye ni nchina naka niromolhiye mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Paahi etu Nlhuku nomoonelha ikiriri ntu riyoothe nothanana awe umoonelha ikiriri, ni unhelha itiyamaru ntu nonthanana awe unhelha itiyamaru.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urushiya ni ikiriri ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Vekinaka mmoka inyu nookikoha, “Yakhalhaka chiicho etu, nlhatuni etu Nlhuku noowona attu wiira ahowonya? Mpani etu nohalha uvinga chinottuna awe Nlhuku?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nansho phi apani inyu, mpaka nkoherere uttuna wa Nlhuku? Chani iyoopwe inowooria unkoha ntu upilhe wiira, “Nlhatuni no ukuupa thoko choo?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ntu owuupa miapu hanaa ikuru yo wuupa wo ulhoko urinawe miapu miilhi, mmoka wo weesheriya chittu cho maana ni nkina wo weesheriya ikokonokhwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Chiichammo phiri aya wa Nlhuku. Ahothanana wooniha urushiya wawe ni waahimeria attu achuwelhe ikuru awe. Ukhalhawaya ahaavilhelha chinene attu anrushilhe, yaaphwanelhiye ulhakalhihiya. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Tho ahothanana woonechesha winchiva wo nthimicho awe animinenlhe awe hii, noonenlhe ikiriri awe, hii nishungilhe awe toka khalhayi niwe naapochera nthimicho wawe. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ukhalhawaya hii phi attu niihanne awe, nihikhumme mwa Ayahudi vekha ayaru nansho tho munlhokoni mwa attu ahiri Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Phi chiichammo Athithi chinohimia aya nkitabuni mwa anamilhohi Nahosea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Attu ahiri awaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Kinoweehana ‘Attu aka’.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Nikosho kahaattunne aka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Kinoweehana vano, ‘Kinaattuna aka’.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Ni vakittu veerelhiya aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Mwaatti kanhiwe attu aka,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">Wowo anowiihaniya ‘ashaana a Nlhuku ri nkumi.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Chiichammo anamilhohi ashinna Isaya vanonlhelha aya attu o Israeli chineera aya, “Inakhalhaka attu o Israeli ari enchi thoko nhaava wo umbwaani, attu vakani tu phi nohalha woopolhiya, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ukhalhawaya Athithi anootimiriha chitema ihukumu aya vachulhu ilhapo yonkhaye.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Thoko tho ashinna Isaya chenre aya khalhayi wiira, “Yakaari Athithi o Machiri khanihiyenre ashaana akina o Uisraeli, nanlhikaana thoko attu o Usodoma, ni ukhalha thoko attu o Ugomora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anowaalhapelhelha attu o Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Paahi niireke etu wiira attu ahiri Ayahudi, ahinovarechesha ikekhia, Nlhuku haalhakelha wo nrima urinaya, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />uno attu o Israeli athothaka malhehero o waapanga ooniye ahopanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku nansho khayaapantte ittu. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Nlhatuni etu? Ukhalhawaya khayaari akhulhuvelhaka upisha nrima nansho aakhulhuvelha mitheko chaapanga aya. Paahi etu ahowulhuwelha “Va nlhuku ninokwakwathuwa attu”. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chilhempe aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Mwooneke, kinoweemesha nlhuku Usayuni ninohalha aya ukwakwathuwa attu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Kiheesha mwalha unaawulhusha attu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Nansho ntu riyoothe nohalha urumelhelha khanowa olhihiya muru.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ashilhoko aka, ittu kinoweherera aka wo nrima chinene iri woona ashilhoko aka Aisraeli anowoopolhiya! Phi naalhapelha aka wa Nlhuku ikatema yonkhaye! <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Kinowaahimiechesha wiira anowiimananiha chinene umwaavia Nlhuku, nansho umananiha waya uhinchuwelhaka Nlhuku rata. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ukhalhawaya khachuwenlhe iphiro Nlhuku chineeriha awe attu ukhalha oombone mmiholho wawe. Ni ayo aholhikacha wo iphiro aya ashineneru yo wiicheesha mmathathani mwa Nlhuku nkayaahiya iphiro ya Nlhuku inowaalhakelha attu ikekhia wiira arumelhelhiye. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ukhalhawaya uwa wa Kuristo uhomalhiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa, ikhalhe wiira attu anrumelhelha aalhakelhiye ikekhia.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woopolhiya uri wa attu onkhaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Wo nlhatu no uratihiya ni Nlhuku nhina Malhehero, ashinna Musa aalhempe wiira, “Ntu riyoothe novarechesha Malhehero nookhalha wo mathananelho o ikekhia.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Nansho wo nlhatu no waalhakelhiya ikekhia wo iphiro yo upisha nrima, ashinna Musa aneera, “Nhiikohe munrimani mwinyu wiira, mpani nohalha uwelha wiirimu?” Wowo phi unkurusha Kuristo vathi. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Mena nhiire, “Mpani nohalha ukhuruwa unaminepa?” Wowo phi ummwelhiha Kuristo ukhuma unookhwani. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Nttenga wa Nlhuku uri vamoka ni inyu, uri vamalhakuni winyu ni munrimani mwinyu.” Ikhalhaka phi nrima ninohimiacha ihu. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Mwahimiachaka wo malhaku inyu wiira Yesu Kuristo phi Athithi ni urumelhelha munrimani mwinyu wiira Nlhuku ahonhihimusha nnookhwani, nnowoopolhiya.<verse eid="ROM 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ukhalhawaya ntu arumelhelhaka munrimani nowaalhakelhiya ikekhia ni arumelhelhaka vamalhakuni nowoopolhiya. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Ntu riyoothe nonrumelhelha, khanoolhihiya muru.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ukhalhawaya Ayahudi khamwalhanne ni attu Ayunani, Nlhuku phi yoyo ri Athithi athumwanaya attu onkhaye, ni o rera wa attu onkhaye anonlhepelha. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Kila ntu nohalha ulhapelha wo nchina na Athithi, nowoopolhiya.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Nansho anohalha unlhapelha chani uyo etu ahinonrumelhelha aya? Tho, anohalha unrumelhelha chani ahinaya umwiiwa? Ni ayo anohalha wiiwa chani vahiri ntu o unhimiacha? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Ni attu anohalha unhimiacha chani ahirumiye? Thoko malhove Orera chineera aya wo uhimia, “Vari voorera chinene vanowa aya attu o uhimiacha Malhove Oombone!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Nansho kahiwe onkhaye apochenre Malhove Orera. Ukhalhawaya ashinna Isaya ahopacha wiira, “Athithi, apani arumelhenlhe nttenga wihu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Paahi etu, upisha nrima unowa wo wiiwa nttenga, ni nttenga unowa wo uhimiachiya malhove a Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Nansho kinookoha etu, ana khaneewa nttenga? Eiyo, aheewa thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Nlhove naya nihowanelha velhaponi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">Malhove aya ahophiya mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Kinookoha tho, attu o Uisraeli khachuwenlhe? Ashinna Musa phi achokhonlhe uhimmia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Kinouholhani ichuku wiira, mwoonelhe ihache</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Attu ahiri ni nikosho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Kinouhelhani ichuku yo waathunalhelha attu o nikosho no uphupuwalha.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Tho ashinna Isaya ahominda venre aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Attu ahaakavia ahokoona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">Kiheechooniha wa attu ahaakikoherera.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Nansho vanaacha aya attu o Uisraeli enre, “Uthana woothe kahookolhelha miono chaka waapochera attu o uwonya, ni attu o tiyamaru.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku nowoonelha ikiriri attu o Uisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Paahi etu kinookoha, chani Nlhuku ahaakhota attu awe? Ata mena! Mii kimwanene ki ntu o Uisraeli, uchuulhu wa Aburahimu, kinokhuma nikosho ni Nabenyamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nlhuku khaakhonte attu awe, aathanlhe awe toka khalhayi. Mwaatti nhochuwelha Malhove Matakatifu anaacha Naeliya vaachukunlhe aya wa Nlhuku wo nlhatu ni attu o Israeli, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Thithi, aheevakacha anamilhohi inyu ni uphomolha madhubahu inyu, Mii vekha aka phi halhenlhe, ni ayo anothanana ukithurulha ukumi aka.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nlhuku aakhunlhe chani? Enre, “Kihaashungerera attu maelufu saba ahinonthimicha Baali, nlhuku o woothiya.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Wo yeyo iphiro iyo phiri aya etu, ahaawo attu vakani aathanlhiye wo nlhatu no ikiriri ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Uthanlha wawe unokhuma wo ikiriri awe, ni mena kuhiwe wo mitheko chaya. Ukhalhawaya, uthanlha wawe ukaakhulhuvenlhe mitheko cha attu, ikiriri awe khayaashichira tho.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Vano chani etu? Attu o Israeli khapantte ittu yaavia aya, nansho attu aathanlhiye ni Nlhuku ahopatta. Attu akina ayo ahoomihiya mirima. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Thoko chilhepiye ni Malhove Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">“Nlhuku hoomiha nrima aya ni irusho chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">Haavaha miitho nansho ahoonaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">Haavaha maaru nansho khaneewa mpaka nna.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ni ayo Adaudi aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Isikuukuu chaya chikhalhe phi nriankho wo waawayiha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">Awulhuwe, ni utwarushiya!<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Miitho aya atiyelhelhiye ahoone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Mithana chaya chikhuruthulhiye ahuve mahuku onkhaye.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Paahi etu, kikohe, Ayahudi yahokwakwathuwa nkayaawulhuwa, nkayaamalhamalha? Ata vakani mena! Wo uwonya waya, woopolhiya uhaakhuruwelha attu ahiri Ayahudi, wiira yoonelhiye ihache ni Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Uwonya wa Ayahudi uhowiiha mpuha mwinchi velhaponi, ni itiamaru aya yo munrimani ihowiiha ibarakha chinchi wa attu ahiri Ayahudi. Paahi etu iri mwaini, Ayahudi wo unhokolhelha waya Nlhuku uhoowiiha ibarakha chinchi chinene.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woopolhiya attu ahiri Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Paahi etu vano, kinouhimeriani mwaatti nhiri Ayahudi va wiira, ukhalhawaya mii kihokhalha karumiya a attu ahiri Ayahudi, kinothimicha ntheko aka, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kinothanana waapanga attu ashikhunanaka owonelheni ihache mwaatti, wiira kiwe koopolha akina aya. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Yakhalhaka wo ukhotiya waya ilhapo yaheewanana ni Nlhuku, inowa ukhalha chani etu vanohalha aya upocheriya ni Nlhuku vawo? Attu akhwilhe anoohihimmwa!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Yakhalhaka imbamu yo upachera yo nkatte phi ikumihiye awe Nlhuku, nkatte wonkhaye unookhalha wa Nlhuku. Mithithaari chakhalhaka chitakatifu, maritta ni ayo chiicho anookhalha chiichammo. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Eiyo, maritta makina o nzeituni ahotupulhiya vaamenlhe aya nkamwaaphateelhiya maritta o nzeituni wo mwiithuphini. Mwaatti nhiri Ayahudi va, nri akavihi o maritta o nzeituni wo mwiithuphini, nrii vano mpuhaka ukumi wo munnepani wa Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Paahi etu, nhaapangelhe mattepwa attu akhwachiye thoko maritta! Kwaani nneefunelhani? Muupuwelheke etu, mwaatti khannokhulhuvelha mithithaari, nansho mithithaari phi noukhulhuvelhani.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Nansho nnowa mweera, “Eiyo, maritta ahotupulhiya wiira hii niphateelhiye vanipuroni waya.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Yeyo phi ikekhiaye. Maritta aatupulhiye wo nlhatu no wuuma nrima, uno inyu mwaatti nneemelha wo nlhatu no nrima winyu. Nansho nhiifunelhe yoyo mwaha uyo, nansho nkhalheke mwoovaka. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Yakhalhaka etu Nlhuku khoonenlhe ikiriri Ayahudi, arii thoko maritta anenene, chani nnowoona wiira nowoonelhani ikiriri inyuva? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Nkoonani etu, Nlhuku chinre awe wo urera nrima ni woopiha. Ri o uchacha wa attu awulhuwilhe, ni orera nrima uwaninyu mwaatti, mwathepaka ukhalha mu urerani mwawe. Nansho mwaahilhokelheke mu urerani mwawe, ni inyu chiicho nnootupulhiya. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ni Ayahudi chiicho, yarumelhelhaka wo nrima, anoophateelhiya tho waari aya, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nowooria waaphateelha tho. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Inyu mwaatti ahiri Ayahudi va, nri thoko maritta o nzeituni wo mwiithuphini ukhwachiye, nkamwaaphateelhiya mmatani nhiri mwawinyu. Nansho Ayahudi phi nzeituni wo mmatani, ni khavanorika wa Nlhuku waalhutaaniha tho umwirini utupulhiye aya.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhuku noowoonelha ikiriri attu onkhaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ashilhoko aka, kihothanana nchuwelhe ithelhi ivithiye ilha, nhiwe mweechoona o irusho chinene. Itiyamaru ya Ayahudi khayaari yo ulhokelha chinene, yaari mpaka ahiri Ayahudi aathananiye vanohalha aya unhokolheelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Vavawo phi ikatema attu o Israeli onkhaye vanohalha aya woopolhiya, thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Noopo nowa ukhuma Usayuni uthamihani uwonya wa ashaana a Nayakhobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Alha phi malhehano aka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">Vanohalha aka uthamiha uwonya waya.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ukhalhawaya Ayahudi ahokhota Malhove Orera, ahokhalha vano amalhaponi a Nlhuku wo nlhatu ninyu mwaatti nhiri Ayahudi va. Nansho ukhalhawaya Nlhuku ahaathanlha, arii akhalhaka ni unlhoko ni Nlhuku, wo nlhatu no manyaapwiiya aya. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku aathanlhaka attu, ni woonelha ikiriri khanorukunuwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Thoko mwaatti nhiri Ayahudi va, khalhayi mwahonkhota Nlhuku, nansho vano nhopochera ikiriri ya Nlhuku wo nlhatu no itiyamaru ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Chiichammo etu, wo nlhatu no ikiriri ipochenre inyu, Ayahudi vano khanomwiiwelhelha Nlhuku, wiira ni ayo apochere ikiriri ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku haattuka attu onkhaye ahiiwelhelhe, wiira oonelhe ikiriri onkhaye.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotopelhiye Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Nhakhu ni irusho ni uchuwelha wa Nlhuku uri wo winchiva chinene! Ihukumu chawe khanchinkohakohia, ni iphiro chawe khachinoria uhimiachiya!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Mpani nochuwelha irusho cha Athithi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Mpani nooria waavaha irusho cho weettuchiha?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Ama mpani panche waavaha ittu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">Wiira ahokolhosheriye?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ukhalhawaya chittu chonkhaye chuupiye ni uyo, ni chiyo chonkhaye chikhumme wo wooria wawe ni wo nlhatu wawe. Nthimicho ukhalhe wa Nlhuku wo mahuku o uhimalha! Aye.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mwiikumiheke uvara ntheko wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Paahi etu, ashilhoko aka, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku hochara ikiriri yinchi, kinoulhepelhani etu wiira, mwiikumiheke iruttu chinyu mwaashinene ukhalha isadaka ikumi wa Nlhuku, isadaka itakatifu, inonteelhiha. Yeyo phi iphiro inyu yoombone yo unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Nhittwarihe makhalhelho o velhaponi va, nansho munhiyeke Nlhuku olhokiheni wo urukunusha irusho chinyu. Vavawo phi nohalha inyu uchuwelha uttuna wa Nlhuku ni uchuwelha ittu yoombone inonteelhiha nrima itiminre.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Wo nnema kivanhe awe Nlhuku, kinouhimeriani mwaatti onkhaye wiira, nhiichoone ukhalha olhupalhe upwaha chiphavelhiye inyu. Nansho irusho chinyu chikhalheke ni maphimelho o nrima wa Nlhuku chinvanhe awe kila mmoka inyu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Thoko iruttu chihu chiri aya ni itturi chinchi ni kila itturi ikhalhaka ni ntheko waya. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Chiichammo etu, inakhalhaka nirii enchi, nirii o iruttu imoka ilhutaanihiye ni Kuristo, ni kila ntu alhutaanaka ukhalha itturi ya nkhunanawe. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ukhalhawaya kila ntu hanaa mahalha avahiye awe wo ikiriri ya Nlhuku. Ntu avahiyaka mahalha o uhimiacha malhove a Nlhuku, ahimiacheke etu wo ulhikaana nrima urina awe. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ntu ri ni mahalha o uwaakaviha akina, aakaviheke rata etu. Ntu vahiye mahalha wiittuchiha, eettuchiheke rata. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ntu vahiye mahalha o waahelha nrima attu akina, eereke chiicho. Ntu o mahalha o waakawelha akhunanawe, aakawelheke wo nrima woombone. Ntu o weemelhelha, emelhelheke wo umindelha, ni ntu riyoothe noonelha ikiriri akhunanawe, oonelheke wo mpuha.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Mwattunaka nttuneke chinene. Nhikhalhe mu iphiro iriyoothe yo uhilhoka, mpangeke chittu choombone. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ashilhoko aka nttunaneke wo nrima woombone, ni kila mmoka anlhoheke nkhunanawe. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Nhilhamwelhamwe, vanovara inyu ntheko wa Athithi, nteelhiyeke munrimani. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ukhulhuvelha winyu ukhalheke wo mpuha, nvilhelheke vanohuva inyu ni unlhapelha Nlhuku ikatema chonkhaye. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mwaakawelheke ittu attu a Nlhuku vanokwana aya, mwaapochereke alheto rata.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Mwaalhapelheke ibarakha attu onkhaye anoupangelhani ichimwa, eiyo, mwaalhapelheke ibarakha, mena nhaalhave. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Nteelhiyeke vamoka ni attu anoteelhiya, munlheke ni attu anonlha. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Nkhalheke wo wiiwanana mwaashineneru. Nhiihelhelhe, nansho nchenjeukelheke chittu chikani. Nhiichoone ukhalha attu o irusho chinchi.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nhinhukumulhe ntu opangelhakani chittu cho unanara, nhinhokolhoshere chittu cho uhilhoka. Mpangeke chittu choombone mwaattuni. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Mmananiheke wo kila inooria inyu, wiira mwaakhalhane attu onkhaye wo mpuha. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ashilhoko aka nnottuniya, nhilhivelhihe milhatu, nansho yoyo mwaha uyo munhiyereke Nlhuku. Ukhalhawaya iholhepiya “Athithi aheera, Ulhivelhelhiha uri wawaka, kinoowa kaalhivelhelhiha.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Tho wo uthepa, Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Amalhaponi inyu awolhiyaka ithalha, mwaavaheke yolhia, awolhiyaka nttona mwaavaheke yo uwuria, ukhalhawaya mweeraka chiicho, nnowoolhiha muru chinene, thoko waavalhelha makhalha vamuruni.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Uwonya uhuwulhusheni, nansho, mmulhusheke uwonya wo upanga moombone.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Wiiwelhelha iserekali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kila ntu ewelhelheke ahoolhelhi chineera aya, ukhalhawaya ikuru cho utawara cho velhaponi cheeshiye ni Nlhuku. Nlhuku vekha awe phi naavaha attu machiri o utawara. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Nansho ntu riyoothe nokhota ikuru yo ahoolhelhi yoyo nokhota malhehero a Nlhuku, ni ntu riyoothe nopanga chiicho noohukumulhiya. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ukhalhawaya ahoolhelhi anotawara khanooviya ni attu anopanga moombone, nansho anooviya ni attu awonnye. Ni inyu mwathananaka wiira nhoove attu o ikuru, mpangeke moombone, ni ayo anoutotopelhani. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ukhalhawaya yayo phi akarumiya a Nlhuku anoupangelhani moombone. Nansho mwawonyaka, mwooveke etu, ukhalhawaya ahanaa ikuru yo utwarushani. Yayo phi anamitheko a Nlhuku akunshe ntwarusho nawe wa attu ammwonya. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Paahi etu mwaathimicheke attu o utawara, kuhiwe wo nlhatu wo woova ntwarusho na Nlhuku vekha aya, nansho tho thoko nrima chineera aya wo uthanana.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, phi nolhiva inyu ikhodi, ukhalhawaya yayo phi ahoolhelhi anovara ntheko wa Nlhuku vanotimiriha aya ntheko aya. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Munlhiveke kila ntu inomphwanelha awe, ntu o upochera chittu chinothananiya mummaheke chittu chinothananiya, ntu o ulhiviha ikhodi, munlhiveke ikhodi, ni waathimicha attu onkhaye rata.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waathana naashineneru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Nhikhalhe ni milhatu wa ntu riyoothe, ihikhalhe nlhatu wo uttunana mwaashineneru. Ntu riyoothe nontuna namwaatamana awe, yoyo hovarelha Malhehero, <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />ukhalhawaya, malheheriyo aneera, “Nhilhuve, nhiive, nhiiye, nhimirelhe ishenye ittu ya ntu” chonkhaye chi, ni makina ayo, anothukumanihiya ni nlheheriyo, “Mwaattuneke amwaatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwaanene.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Mwaattunaka amwaatamana inyu, khannaapangelha ichimwa, waattuna, phi utimiriha Malhehero onkhaye.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nchuwelheke wiira, ihaaya ikatema inyu yo wunkwa nkhoveni. Ikatema ihu yo woopolhiya iri vakhiviru chinene, upwaha ikatema iriyoothe yaarumelhenlhe ihu. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Uhosha, uthana uhaatameria. Nihiyeke etu chittu chonkhaye cho mwiipiphini, nipangeke chittu cho woonia voonene. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Nikhalheke rata thoko chinokhalha ihu uthana, nihimenyekhe ni uhapalhiya chittu cho uhilhoka, mena ulhuvalhuva mena waana indewo mena ihache. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Mwaawareke Athithi Yesu Kuristo, nhiwonye tho, mena upanga chittu cho uhilhoka.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Nhaahukumulhe akina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mwaapochereke attu akina ahiri ni nrima, nansho nhaahukumulhe wo nlhatu no uyeva irusho chaya. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mirima cha attu akina chiri cho uvirikana, akina chinaaruma ulhia ittu iriyoothe, nansho attu o nrima mwankani anolhia mathaakhuru vekha ayaru. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Ntu nolhia ittu iriyoothe himpangelhe ncheche ntu hinolhia chittu chikina, ni ntu nolhia mathaakhururu hinhukumulhe ntu nolhia kila ittu, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku haattuna onkhaye. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Mwa apani inyu, ata munhukumulhe karumiya a ntu nkina? Eemelhaka ama awulhuwaka Athithi anene phi nochuwelha nlhatu wawe. Eiyo, anowa eemelha rata ukhalhawaya Athithi anowooria umweemesha.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Ntu nkina naanyihera wiira, nihawo nihuku nimpwaha mahuku makina, uno ntu nkina oonaka wiira mahuku onkhaye aholhikaana. Kila ntu etu, achuwelheke inoona awe munrimani mwawe wiira iholhoka. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ntu noona wiira nihuku nimoka nihothepa nikina naathimicha Athithi, ni ntu nolhia ittu iriyoothe naathimicha Athithi, ukhalhawaya anopochera ukhuma wa Athithi. Ntu riyoothe hinottuna ulhia chittu chikina, yoyo chiicho nopanga wo waathimicha Athithi, ni uyo nonshukuru Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ukhalhawaya khaawo ntu mmoka ihu neelhokelhiha mwaneneru, mena khaawo ntu nokhwa mwaneneru, <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />ukhalhawaya nalhokelhaka, Athithi anene phi no unilhokelhiha ama nakhwaaka ninkhwa wo nlhatu naya Athithi, hii onkhaye va phi awaya Athithi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ukhalhawaya Kuristo ahokhwa nkaahihimmwa awe aatawara attu akumi ni attu akhwilhe. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Paahi etu mwaatti, nnolhia mathaakhururu va, yeeshiyani waahukumulha attu akina, nlhatu waani etu no waaheulhacha ahima inyu? Muupuwelheke wiira hii onkhaye va, ninoowa neemelha mmiholho wa Nlhuku wiira nihukumulhiye. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Thoko chinolhokelha aka, aneera Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">Kila ntu noowa aakikhoromelha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">Ni kila ntu noowa aahimiechesha wiira mii phi Nlhuku.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Paahi etu kila mmoka ihu, noowa eevaraanga mwanene wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhinttekihe nkhunaninyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Paahi etu, nihiyeke uhukumulhana ashineneru. Nansho, nihiyeke upanga chittu cho waattekiha achihima ihu akina ama waawulhusha mu uwonyani. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mii kilhutanne ni Athithi Yesu, uhokivaha ikekhiaye wiira, khiiwo yolhia ikelhiye nsheru, nansho ntu oonaka wiira yolhia ineshe ihokelhiya nsheru, paahi etu nsheru unkhalha wa yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Mwanthunalhihaka nkhunaninyu, wo nlhatu no yolhia nnolhia inyu, paahi etu uttunana khuuwo. Yolhia inolhia inyu ihimpoterihe ntu nkina, Kuristo ankhwenlhe awe! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Paahi etu nhihiyerere urera winyu unanarihiye ni mitheko cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku khiri mwaha wo mu ulhiani ni uwuriyani, nansho mwaha wo upanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku ni mpuha ni uteelhiya ummwiihiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Attu avaraka ntheko wa Kuristo thoko chiicho, ahonteelhiha Nlhuku ni urumelhelhiya ni attu akina.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Paahi etu, wo ikatema chonkhaye, nivarechesheke meetelho anowiiha mpuha anonikaviha wiitheka ni ashineneru. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Mena nhihononache ntheko wa Nlhuku wo nlhatu no yolhia. Wo ikekhiaye cholhia chonkhaye chorera, chilhiyeke, nansho khinolhoka ntu ulhia yolhia inohalha unttekiha ntu nkina. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ittu yorera irii nambaya uhikhuura inama, uwuria idivai mena upanga ittu iriyoothe ikina inohalha waawonyiha ahima inyu ama arokorinyu. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Paahi etu nvarechesheke nrima inyu wa Nlhuku inyu. Ahoreeriya attu onkhaye ahinehukumulha wiira ahotteka vanovarechesha aya nlhove ninoona aya wiira niholhoka! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nansho ntu akelhiyaka nipampa no mwaha wo cholhia, Nlhuku nonhukumulha alhiaka, ukhalhawaya chinopanga awe khachinolhikaana ni upisha nrima wawe. Ni ittu iriyoothe ihinaathana ni nrima wa ntu phi uwonya.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaateelhiheke attu akina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Hii nikhomanlhe munrimani va, ninothananiya naakaviheke akhunanihu ahineemelha rata ayo, orie weemelha. Nihiilhoheke hii ashineneru. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Nansho, kila ntu anlhoheke nkhunanawe wo nrima woombone, wiira ankhomaalhihe munrimani. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ukhalhawaya Kuristo kheelhonhe mwaneneru. Nansho, thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Uruwaniya winyu wonkhaye uhokiwulhuwelha mii.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ukhalhawaya kila ittu, ilhepiye wo nlhatu wo uniittuchiha hii, wiira wo uvilhelha ni uhelhiya nrima ni Malhove Matakatifu ayo, nipatte ittu yo ukhulhuvelha. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nlhuku ri machokholhelho o uvilhelha ni uhelha nrima, ovaheni irusho cho ukhalha ittu imoka nttwaraka chenre awe Kuristo Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ni inyu mwaatti wo nrima mmoka ni nlhove nimoka munthimiche Nlhuku, Athumwanaya Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove Orera wa attu ahiri Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Paahi etu mwaatti, mpocheraneke mwaashineneru thoko Kuristo chenre awe wo upocherani, wo unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ukhalhawaya, kinouhimeriani wiira Kuristo ahokhalha karumiya wa attu enelhiye unyawo mu ikekhiani oonihe wiira Nlhuku phi o ukhulhuvelhiya, ni malhehano aalhenhe awe manyaapwiiya ihu, anootimira, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ni wooriha attu o makosho makina anthimiche Nlhuku wo ikiriri awe thoko chihimiye ni Malhove Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ni mii kinouthimichani mwa attu ahiri Ayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Kinowiipa ichipo cho utotopelha nchina ninyu.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Tho aneera wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Nttapelhelheke, mwaatti ahiri Ayahudi va, vamoka ni attu a Nlhuku!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Tho, Malhove aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mwaatotopelheke Athithi mwaatti ahiri Ayahudi va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">Attu onkhaye mwaatotopelheke!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Tho ashinna Isaya aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Noowa aakhumelhelha ntu mu iyari ya Nayese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">Noowa aatawara attu ahiri Ayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">Ni ayo anoowa ankhulhuvelha.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Paahi etu, Nlhuku ri machokholhelho o ukhulhuvelha, ochariheni mpuha ni uteelhihani thoko chineera inyu wo unrumelhelha, ikhalhe wiira ukhulhuvelha winyu uthepe wo machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntheko u Napaolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ashilhoko aka, mii kimwanene kinookhulhuvelha wiira, ni inyu mwaatti nhovahiya nrima woombone wonkhaye ni irusho chinchi mwooriaka wiittuchihana mwaashineneru. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nansho kinoolhepa ilha iwarakha ilha wo uhoova, kuwuupusheni tho. Kineera chiicho wo nnema ukivanhe awe Nlhuku, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />wo ukithanlha ukhalha karumiya a Yesu Kuristo wa attu ahiri Ayahudi. Kiri kivaraka ntheko thoko opochera ishaani wo uhimiacha Malhove Orera a Nlhuku, wiira attu ahiri Ayahudi akhalhe phi isadaka inopocheriya ni Nlhuku, isadaka ipangiye itakatifu wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Paahi etu, wo ukhalha nhina mwawe Kuristo Yesu, kinowiititihacha vano wo ntheko kinopanga aka wo nlhatu na Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Kinowulhumacha wo umindelha ittu ipannge awe Kuristo Yesu, ukivaha mii wiira kaaholhelhe attu ahiri Ayahudi anrumelhelhe Nlhuku. Hopanga chiicho wo malhove ni mitheko, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />wo machiri o ushangiha ni uthikineeha, ni wo machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku. Paahi etu, kihohimiacha rata Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo munkwahani mwaka ukhuma Uyerusalemu mpaka Uiluriko. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ittu kinothanana aka mahuku onkhaye urii uhimiacha Malhove Orera a Nlhuku ilhapo chonkhaye vahinahimiachiya nchina na Kuristo, kihiwe kaatheka vachulhu nsingi wa ntu nkina. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Attu onkhaye ahinahimeriya anoowa yoona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">Ni attu onkhaye ahinapacha umwiiwa anoowa aachuwelha.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anoolhakelha urwaa Uroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, kahochiichihiya venchi wiira kihiwe uwaninyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Nansho ukhalhawaya vano kihomalhiha ntheko aka chilha ilhapo chilha, ni ukhalhawaya wo iyaakha chinchi kaari kilhakelhaka uwa uwoonani mwaatti, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />kinookhulhuvelha vano upanga chommo. Kihothanana uwoonani mwaatti, munkwahani vanorwaa aka Uhispaniya, ni inyu mmwe mwaakivaha ittu yo ukipiiha wowo, kamalhaka uukhalhanani wo mpuha wo mahuku vakani. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Nansho vano kinokelha thoko Uyerusalemu, uwaakavihani attu a Nlhuku arii wowo.<verse eid="ROM 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ukhalhawaya attu o Umakedoniya ni attu o Uakaya ahoona ihorera ukumiha ittu yo waarwehelha nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku ankwana o Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Enre chiicho ashineneru, nansho we ikekhiaye, yeyo phi nothananiya aya upanga. Ukhalhawaya yakhalhaka attu ahiri Ayahudi ahopochera ibarakha cho munnepani cha Ayahudi, ahophwanelhiya ni ayo vano waakaviha Ayahudi apatte chittu chinophavelha aya. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Vanohalha aka umalhiha yoyo ntheko uyo ni waavaha nchurukhu urweehelhiye aya uyo, kinoolhukama Uhispaniya. Phi vavawo etu, vanohalha aka uwa uwoonani vawo. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Vanohalha aka uwa, kinoowa ko uwiiherani ibarakha chinchi cha Kuristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Paahi etu, ashilhoko aka, kinoulhepelhelhani wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ni wo nlhatu wo uttuna unovahiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, wiira nlhutaaneke ni mii wo ukilhapelhelha wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Nkilhapelhelheke wiira koopolhiye kikhume rata wa attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku o Uyudea, ni ulhapelhelha ntheko aka warumelhelhiye ni attu a Nlhuku anokhalha Uyerusalemu uwo. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Paahi chiichammo etu, Nlhuku attunaka, kinoowa nrima aka ukicharaka mpuha kiwe keettuwa vamoka ni inyu mwaatti.<verse eid="ROM 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nlhuku ri machokholhelho o mpuha, akhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye. Aye.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Isalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Kinowaaruma uwaninyu arokorihu Nafoibe, anamitheko anovara ntheko unlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo no Ukinkreya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mwaapochereke wo nchina na Athithi, thoko chineerihiya ni attu a Nlhuku. Mwaakaviheke chinohalha aya uthanana uwaninyu, ukhalhawaya ari orera nrima wa attu enchi ata uwannyaka mii.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Isalamu chaaphiyelheke Aprisila ni Naakwila, anamitheko akhunanaka munthekoni mwa Kuristo Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />yayo yaheesha ukumi waya ntatakoni wo nlhatu naka mii. Ahophwanelhiya ushukuriya, ihikhalhaka uwannyakaru nansho ata wa attu o milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo ahiri Ayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Isalamu tho chipocheriye ni attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo anokumaana unupani winyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Isalamu wa ampwana kinaattuna aka Apaineto, yaari o upacha umpochera Kuristo, ilhapo yo Uasiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Isalamu wa Amariamu, anopanga ntheko mulhupalhe wo nlhatu winyu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Isalamu tho apochere Naandroniko ni Ayuniya, Ayahudi nanaka, aattukiye vamoka ni mii, anochuwania chinene munlhokoni mwa akarumiya, ampochenre Kuristo mii kihinaya.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Isalamu chaka chaaphwanye Naampliato ampwana kinaattuna aka nhina Athithi. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Isalamu tho chirwee wa ashinna Urbani, namitheko nanaka, mu unkavihani Kuristo, ni wa ampwana kinaattuna aka Nastaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Isalamu wa ashinna Apele, o nrima unorumelhelhiya nhina Kuristo. Isalamu wa attu onkhaye anokhalha unupani wa ashinna Aristabulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Isalamu wa Naherodiana, Ayahudi akhunanaka, ni wa Akuristo ari iwani ya ashinna Naarikisi yaalhutanne ni Athithi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Isalamu wa Atrufena ni Atrufosa, manyoopani anovara ntheko wa Athithi, ni wa ampwana kinaattuna aka Napersisi, aapannge ntheko mulhupalhe wo nlhatu na Athithi. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Kinoovelhelha isalamu wa ashinna Ruufo, namitheko a thanlhiye ni Athithi, tho wa anumwanaya, aakipochenre mii thoko mwaamwanaya. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Isalamu chaka chirwee wa Asunkrito ni Naflegoni ni Naheme ni Napatroba ni Nahermasi ni ashilhoko aka anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye nnaakhalhana inyu vamoka. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Isalamu wa Nafilologo ni Ayulia ni wa Nerea ni arokoraya ni wa Naolimpio ni wa attu onkhaye a Nlhuku arii vamoka ni inyu mwaatti.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Nshikurianeke kila mmoka wo wooniha nrima wo uttunana. Milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye va, anouvahani isalamu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove o umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ashilhoko aka, kinoulhepelhelhani wiira, mwaaweheke rata attu onkhaye anowiiha milhatu cho umwalhaana ni waawonyiha attu akina, arukunuwaka meettuchiho mwiittuchihiye inyu. Mwiichinanelheke ni attu thoko yayo! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye aneera chiicho, khanovara ntheko wa Kuristo Athithi, nansho anopanga wo nlhatu no mathunkwa aya. Malhove aya o uchiva ni meettuchiho o upepecha phi nokukureeriha mirima cha attu ahimmwonya. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kila ntu heewa chinre inyu wo weemelha rata ikhalhaka phi nlhatu unokiteelhiha mii. Kinoulhapelhelhani nkhalhe ni irusho cho upanga chittu choombone ni uhiya upanga chittu cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ni uyo Nlhuku, rii machokholhelho o mpuha wihu, khampicha unnyikalha Nakare wuuthi inyaa chinyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ibarakha cha Athithi Yesu Kuristo chikhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Natimotheo, namitheko nanaka, nouvahani isalamu, ni Nalukiyo chiicho ni Nayasoni ni Nasosipetro Ayahudi nanaka anouvahani isalamu. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ni mii Tertiyo, kivahiye ulhepa ilha iwarakha ilha, kinouvahani isalamu mwaatti wo nchina ni Athithi.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Nagayo, kiphiyenlhe aka uwannyaya vamoka ni nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo unokumaana unupani waya, anouvahani isalamu, ni ashinna Erasto arina ipilhi yo ushunga nhakhu wo iwani, vamoka ni onnihu Nakwarto anouvahani isalamu. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ukhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. Aye.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove o unlhapelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Paahi etu vano nintotopelheke Nlhuku! Yoyo phi nooria uweemeshani rata munrimani mwinyu, nhina Malhove Orera kaahimianche aka umwaacha Yesu Kuristo ni upatakulhiya ikeekhene ivithiye toka mahuku o machokholhelho. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Nansho vano, yoyo mwaha uyo, uhopatakulhiya wo iphiro yo Malhove Matakatifu alhepiye ni anamilhohi, achuwaniyaka velhaponi ni wo malheheriyo a Nlhuku o mahuku o uhimalha, ahochuwania wa attu onkhaye, wiira arumelhelhe ni uvarechesha upisha nrima.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Nlhuku vekha awe ri o irusho chonkhaye, nthimicho ukhalheke uwannyawe wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo mahuku onkhaye o uhimalha ni uhimalha! Aye.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>